{"id":"2631de10a773dc04","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set.md","title":"ZFC Desc Analytic Set","display":"df-zfc-desc-analytic-set — ZFC Desc Analytic Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set","58-df-zfc-descriptive2-analytic-set"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-analytic-set — ZFC Desc Analytic Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-analytic-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-analytic-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-analytic-set — ZFC Desc Analytic Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e537464587f340f\" href=\"?note=7e537464587f340f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,A\\in V,\\ A\\subseteq X\">\\(X,\\tau_X,A\\in V,\\ A\\subseteq X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4b3a8629f6a6f868\" href=\"?note=4b3a8629f6a6f868\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S\\)</span> (canonical Baire-space presentation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7e537464587f340f\" href=\"?note=7e537464587f340f\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-baire-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2AnalyticSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2AnalyticSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S:V^4\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S:V^4\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\exists\\tau_{\\mathcal N},d_{\\mathcal N},\\tau_\\times\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},d_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_\\times=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\n(X,\\tau_X,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_\\times)\n\\land A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Polish}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\exists\\tau_{\\mathcal N},d_{\\mathcal N},\\tau_\\times\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S(\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N},d_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_\\times=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\n(X,\\tau_X,\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists B\\subseteq X\\times\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Borel}(B,X\\times\\omega^\\omega,\\tau_\\times)\n\\land A=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in B)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2AnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}analytic\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2AnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcDescAnalyticSet}_S(A,X,\\tau_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-analytic-set</code> is merged here; it used the same Borel-projection definition.</li>\n<li>The witness topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> is now forced to be the canonical cylinder topology constructed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricBaireSpace}_S\\)</span>. Merely asking for some Polish topology on the same carrier does not determine the intended Borel projection pointclass.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b3a8629f6a6f868","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-polish-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[